  1105	def make_combined_figure(summary, path):
  1106	    """One row of panels per arm, so the arms can be read against each other.
  1107	
  1108	    Every row's grey band is the same *kind* of quantity but not the same numbers -- a
  1109	    cylindrical arm's band is CylindricalViT's five-seed SD, a SimpleViT arm's is
  1110	    SimpleViT's -- so the one shared legend entry names no model and each row carries the
  1111	    model its own band came from beside it.  Naming the first arm's model in the legend
  1112	    labelled every row with it (round-2 review, finding 3).
